<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mead Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mead Corp started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan analyst Mark W. Connelly said he initiated coverage of Mead Corp with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of $68.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Mead is beginning to stand out as a bright spot in an industry whose capital returns fell far short of capital costs over the past decade,&quot; Connelly said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/8 at 57-1/8.</p>
</text>
